{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bgs-title","type":"text","text":"# ODDSWELL BETA GAME SCOPE\nOne complete loop: arrive with little, learn the city and league, wager Odds Bucks, then build a better life.","x":0,"y":-250,"width":2040,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bgs-bible","type":"file","file":"Design/Beta Game Bible.md","x":0,"y":-80,"width":2040,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bgs-hour-group","type":"group","x":0,"y":80,"width":620,"height":570,"color":"5","label":"1. FIRST HOUR"},
		{"id":"bgs-city-group","type":"group","x":710,"y":80,"width":620,"height":570,"color":"4","label":"2. CITY + HOME"},
		{"id":"bgs-sport-group","type":"group","x":1420,"y":80,"width":620,"height":570,"color":"2","label":"3. BASKETBALL + ODDS"},
		{"id":"bgs-brain-group","type":"group","x":0,"y":730,"width":620,"height":540,"color":"3","label":"4. ATHLETES + BRAINS"},
		{"id":"bgs-money-group","type":"group","x":710,"y":730,"width":620,"height":540,"color":"6","label":"5. ODDS BUCKS + PROGRESSION"},
		{"id":"bgs-boundary-group","type":"group","x":1420,"y":730,"width":620,"height":540,"color":"1","label":"6. BETA BOUNDARIES"},
		{"id":"bgs-hour-1","type":"text","text":"## 🧍 CHOOSE\nDefault masculine/feminine character presentation • varied skin tones • worn off-white starter clothes","x":40,"y":145,"width":540,"height":125,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bgs-hour-2","type":"text","text":"## 🏙️ ARRIVE\nEnter one original 3D city • see the studio apartment • begin on foot","x":40,"y":295,"width":540,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bgs-hour-3","type":"text","text":"## 🔎 DISCOVER\nFind the job • stadium/sportsbook • clothing store • furniture store","x":40,"y":435,"width":540,"height":115,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bgs-hour-4","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 COMPLETE THE LOOP\nEarn → wager → watch → settle → save or buy an upgrade","x":40,"y":575,"width":540,"height":55,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bgs-city-1","type":"text","text":"## 🏙️ ONE SHARED CITY\nCompact, memorable, walkable. Players see one another and show equipped clothing. City identity requires owner approval.","x":750,"y":145,"width":540,"height":145,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bgs-city-2","type":"text","text":"## 🏠 SIX APARTMENT TIERS\nStudio → 1BR → 2BR → 3BR → 4BR → Penthouse\nHouses and mansions come later.","x":750,"y":320,"width":540,"height":135,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bgs-city-3","type":"text","text":"## 🛍️ BASIC STORES\nSmall clothing and furniture catalogs. Purchased items visibly improve the avatar or apartment.","x":750,"y":485,"width":540,"height":125,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bgs-sport-1","type":"text","text":"## 🏀 FIRST SPORT\nTwo fictional teams • persistent athletes • 82-game season target • shared authoritative games • short visual presentation","x":1460,"y":145,"width":540,"height":135,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bgs-sport-2","type":"text","text":"## 🎟️ BETA MARKET TARGETS\n1. Winner  2. Margin  3. Overtime  4. Player points\nIntroduce and validate one market at a time.","x":1460,"y":310,"width":540,"height":145,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bgs-sport-3","type":"text","text":"## 🎬 WATCH\nInitial target: 2–5 minutes • show score, clock, athletes, key actions, overtime, and wager events • never resimulate","x":1460,"y":485,"width":540,"height":145,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bgs-brain-1","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 DISTINCT ATHLETES\nRare generational stars • specialists • average and below-average players • durable strengths and weaknesses","x":40,"y":795,"width":540,"height":145,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bgs-brain-2","type":"text","text":"## 🌙 LIFE CONSEQUENCES\nTrain • rest • recover • socialize/club • injuries • temporary doubt or form\nEvery effect needs a visible fictional causal chain.","x":40,"y":970,"width":540,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bgs-brain-3","type":"text","text":"## 🔒 AUTHORITY\nBrain chooses legal intent → rules engine resolves → event log records → client renders","x":40,"y":1160,"width":540,"height":85,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bgs-money-1","type":"text","text":"## 💵 ODDS BUCKS ONLY\nEarn at work • wager • win or lose • save • buy clothing, furniture, and apartment upgrades","x":750,"y":795,"width":540,"height":145,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bgs-money-2","type":"text","text":"## 🧰 RECOVERY LOOP\nIf broke, wait for or complete the next job/allowance opportunity. Amounts and timing remain OPEN.","x":750,"y":970,"width":540,"height":135,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bgs-money-3","type":"text","text":"## ⏳ NOT IN BETA\nNo real-money Odds Bucks purchases. Later only after legal, platform, payment, age, region, fraud, and audit gates.","x":750,"y":1135,"width":540,"height":110,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bgs-boundary-1","type":"text","text":"## ✅ BETA MUST PROVE\nOne complete city → work → wager → watch → settlement → lifestyle-upgrade loop","x":1460,"y":795,"width":540,"height":125,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bgs-boundary-2","type":"text","text":"## ❓ ASK THE OWNER\nCity identity • engine/version • 82-game variety/team count • multiplayer capacity • job/economy numbers • visual fidelity","x":1460,"y":950,"width":540,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bgs-boundary-3","type":"text","text":"## 🚧 LATER\nItem trading • other sports/fights • houses/mansions • multiple cities • travel • full careers • real-money credits","x":1460,"y":1140,"width":540,"height":105,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[]
